-         row  `NoCommonAlgorithm(kind)`  3  _the server offers no supported `kind` algorithm_  `key exchange`, `host key` or `cipher`
-         row  `HostKeyRejected(keyType)`  4  _the server's `keyType` host key was not accepted_  the `Ssh.HostKeys` policy refused the key
-         row  `BadSignature`  5  _the server's signature over the exchange is wrong_  the host key's signature over the exchange hash failed to verify
-         row  `Disconnected(code, text)`  6  _the server disconnected with code `code`: `text`_  the server sent `SSH_MSG_DISCONNECT`
